The Little Prince is a science fiction, fantasy,
family film directed by Stanley Donen.

3
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:42,000
After a pilot is forced to make an emergency landing in the Sahara Desert, he befriends a young prince from outer
space; the friendship conjures up stories of journeys through the solar system for the stranded aviator.

4
