10
00:58:40,000 --> 00:58:46,000
The Little Prince is a 1974 sci-fi fantasy-musical film with screenplay and lyrics by Alan Jay
Lerner, music by Frederick Loewe, arranged and orchestrated by Angela Morley.

11
01:04:32,000 --> 01:04:38,000
It was both directed and produced by Stanley Donen and based on the 1943 classic children-adult's novella, The Little Prince (Le Petit Prince), by the writer, poet
and aviator Count Antoine de Saint-Exupéry, who disappeared near the end of the Second World War some 15 months after his fable was first published.

12
01:10:24,000 --> 01:10:30,000
It was nominated for Academy Awards for Best Song Score and Best Original Song.

13
01:16:16,000 --> 01:16:22,000
The film explores themes of prince, pilot, musical, little boy, planet.

14
01:22:08,000 --> 01:22:14,000
The tone is thought_provoking.
